2026-07-27T10:58:48.4082524Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4083224Z i /tmp/RtmpoZVcoC/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4083680Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4084239Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4084697Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4085375Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4086441Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:58:48.4087739Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
